PRE-RELEASE. This is not an open-source licence, and it is deliberately a
narrow one — the terms this project ships under long-term have not been
decided, and inventing them here would be pretending otherwise.

WHAT YOU MAY DO

If you have been given access to this repository by the copyright holder, you
may install it, run it, read it, and build and publish your own applications
with it. Anything you make with it is yours; see below.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

Redistribute this software or derivative works of it, offer it to third parties
as a hosted or managed service, or remove or alter this notice.

APPS YOU BUILD ARE NOT COVERED BY THIS

Everything under template/ and template-v1/ — the chassis every generated app is
built on — is MIT licensed, separately, and those terms are the ones that follow
your app. See template/LICENSE.

That separation is the whole point. A tool that generates your app and then
keeps a claim on the result is not a tool. Nothing in this file reaches the code
App Factory writes for you, and nothing in it can stop you shipping, selling or
relicensing it.

NO WARRANTY

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. This software creates real
accounts, real repositories and real billable cloud resources on your behalf,
and publishes to app stores under your name. You are responsible for what it
does with your credentials.
